        "uid": "bf4q19tuivta8e"
      },
      "description": "Seconds spent in each phase, one point per landing. A tall wait_merge is PR CI or a PR nobody armed; a tall wait_ci is the master sweep; a tall deploy is rollout and stabilisation waits.",
